likes(alice,apple).
likes(bob,banana).
likes(charlie,apple).
========================================================================
%who like same fruit (using unification)
same_taste(Person1,Person2):-
    likes(Person1,Fruit),
    likes(Person2,Fruit),
    Person1 \= Person2. %Not the same person(unifiable but different) ,if we remove this x,y alco tale as same person not different person 
%unnecessarlly person assignment
%X = Y, Y = alice | X = alice,  Y = charlie | X = Y, Y = bob | X = charlie,Y = alice | X = Y, Y = charlie
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
same_taste(alice,charlie).
1true
same_taste(alice,bob).
false
same_taste(X,Y).
X = alice,
Y = charlie
X = charlie,
Y = alice
false

